</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><b><a href=\"/page/Treasure_of_Crystal_Cove\" title=\"Treasure of Crystal Cove\">Treasure of Crystal Cove</a></b>, Turn in <a href=\"/page/Item:Nimble_Trinket\" title=\"Item:Nimble Trinket\">Nimble Trinket</a> (and other ingredients) at <a href=\"/page/Dusty_Old_Treasure_of_Crystal_Cove\" title=\"Dusty Old Treasure of Crystal Cove\">Dusty Old Treasure of Crystal Cove</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Upgradeable_-_Tier_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Upgradeable - Tier 3\">Upgradeable - Tier 3</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>Upgradeable - Tier 3:</b> This is a tier 3 (maximum tier) item. It is not upgradeable.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Attack_bonus\" title=\"Attack bonus\">Attack Bonus +1</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Attack_bonus\" title=\"Attack bonus\">Attack Bonus +1</a>:</b> Provides a +1 <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">competence bonus</a> to your <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack rolls</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Dodge_bonus\" title=\"Dodge bonus\"> Dodge +2%</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Dodge_bonus\" title=\"Dodge bonus\"> Dodge +2%</a>:</b> +2% <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Dodge.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Blurry\" title=\"Blurry\">Blurry</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Blurry\" title=\"Blurry\">Blurry</a>:</b> Equipping this item causes you to become slightly blurry. Attacks from enemies have a 20% chance to miss you due to concealment.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Greater_Nimble_Trinket.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Greater_Nimble_Trinket.png/420px-Greater_Nimble_Trinket.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"363\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Greater_Nimble_Trinket.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>Pirates are deft and light on their feet, able to dodge enemy attacks and land their own with ease.  This trinket boosts the accuracy of your attacks and improves your dodging ability.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p><br />\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817044731\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.068 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.130 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2924/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 19535/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5705/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n123.97%  139.365     42 Template:IO\n100.00%  112.414      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  112.414      1 -total\n 95.95%  107.862      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 44.39%   49.904      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 43.24%   48.605      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 41.01%   46.101      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 38.68%   43.482      2 Template:InCategory\n 21.04%   23.655      6 Template:Popup\n 16.06%   18.050      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:13949-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817044731 and revision id 631240. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"
